Description: Video wallpaper player for Linux (GTK3 + VLC)
 Tux Wallpaper plays video files as desktop wallpaper on Linux.
 It uses GTK3 for window embedding and VLC for video playback,
 providing a D-Bus interface for external control.
 .
 Features:
  * Multi-monitor support
  * Screen lock detection (pause when locked)
  * Window state detection (pause when maximized)
  * Volume fade in/out
  * D-Bus control interface
